            {
              "originalPosition": 31,
              "body": "```suggestion\nAn AI Agent is a system that performs actions on behalf of a principal in a fully or semi-autonomous fashion. AI Agents are growing rapidly in their adoption across the Internet, finding usage in business, consumer, government and other applications.\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-30T11:38:32Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-30T11:38:33Z"
            }
          ]
        },
